{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1087714-should-we-try-converting-our-current-games","id":1087714,"title":"Should we try converting our current games?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-04T08:32:10-07:00","id":1087714,"title":"Should we try converting our current games?","content":"the rule changes for C20 are a major overhaul, rather then minor twinks and clarifications like in W20 and V20<br /> <br /> am a little nervous trying to convert things...<br /> <br /> thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T08:51:44-07:00","id":1087727,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Take what you like, discard what you don't. If a setting element doesn't fit your chronicle - why worry? Just leave it alone for now.<br /> <br /> If there's something you think your game needs to be introduced and your players agree on that, you can look at facts, that are already present in the game, player characters backgrounds - if the things you're decided to change, never had a direct appearance in the game and removing/changing it doesn't upset current and future plots - talk about it, it's probably can be integrated into your shared imaginary world. Some hitches are possible, but if everyone is understanding of each other, you can figure it out.<br /> <br /> And as with D&amp;D, you can always add some metaplot reality warping event, later on, that makes everything different. Like in our<span style=\"font-family:arial\"> current </span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>MtA</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">game, Time of Judgement did happen, all scenarios at once, Daggerfall-style. Virtual Adepts and some other Mages removed the Consensus, let the storm to rage on and then launched a <b>Reality 2.0</b>. Well, a <b>Reality 1.0.844.12\u03b1</b>, to be fair. Helps us to explain a lot about the current state of the world. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T12:37:10-07:00","id":1087862,"title":"","content":"When we remade our original Changeling characters for the play test, we didn't try to copy the characters mechanically. Instead, we went with what felt the most like the characters. Originally, all of the characters were wilders. Remade, one was still a wilder, but the others were a childling and a grump. The same went for the Arts and Realms. One of the characters what (in)famous for her use of Portal Passage, so that one took Wayfare, but I think that was the only one that had any of the same Arts as before. The only part that really gave the players trouble was coming up with an antithesis for their characters, but that was because they had too many ideas and didn't want to limit themselves to just one.<br /> <br /> You'll have to decide if the disruption from remaking the characters and players getting used to the new ways of handling Banality, Bedlam, Arts, Realms, Cantrip casting, and Unleashing is worth the benefit of using the new rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T16:33:54-07:00","id":1087983,"title":"","content":"wrong thread","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10243,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","user":"zenten","date":".  wrong thread 05-04-2017, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T14:28:35-07:00","id":1088852,"title":"","content":"I don't think my game would require much changing. The only big change for our group would be the loss of Discord. But that's not the end of the word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 05-06-2017, 06:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T14:47:12-07:00","id":1088859,"title":"","content":"The nice thing about the Arts is that if there's one a group loved that didn't make it into C20, it doesn't take a whole lot of effort to convert them to C20's system. You just need to come up with how it's Unleashing works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T15:00:59-07:00","id":1088868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1087714-should-we-try-converting-our-current-games?p=1088859#post1088859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The nice thing about the Arts is that if there's one a group loved that didn't make it into C20, it doesn't take a whole lot of effort to convert them to C20's system. You just need to come up with how it's Unleashing works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Discord is better served by other Arts and/or a Merit anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T15:17:22-07:00","id":1088875,"title":"","content":"I don't disagree, but I've seen a couple of people on here missing Contempt and Infusion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T14:24:14-07:00","id":1089957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1087714-should-we-try-converting-our-current-games?p=1088875#post1088875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't disagree, but I've seen a couple of people on here missing Contempt and Infusion.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking of Contempt when I wrote Discord. Ignore me. Discord was cool, but is kinda folded into Dragon's Ire.<br /> <br /> I get why Infusion wasn't included. There's a more generic subsystem for crafting Treasures and Infusion only really worked with one or two Realms.<br /> <br /> Skycraft and Pyretics are my bugbears, since they're basically just more specific uses of Primal, and what isn't could go into the new seasonal Arts. But then, I wouldn't have implemented the seasonal Arts either. Chronos would go too, to be absorbed into Chicanery and Soothsay. <br /> <br /> My list would be:<br /> <br /> Chicanery (emotional and memory manipulation, incorporating Aphrodisia)<br /> Dragon's Ire (incorporating the best of Discord)<br /> Legerdemain<br /> Naming<br /> Oneiromancy (including the best of Dream-craft)<br /> Primal (with a stronger focus on healing, growth and change, and not the stuff covered by the Nature Realm)<br /> Soothsay (with elements of Chronos)<br /> Sovereign (mind control, bans and geases, with Contempt perhaps worked in)<br /> Wayfare<br /> <br /> I'd make a proper subsystem for oaths and contracts, so that anyone can make them with a roll of Intelligence + Gremayre or whatever. The rest of Contracts can be achieved with Sovereign and Soothsay.<br /> <br /> But then, I'm more of a fan of looser, wider Arts with multiple options at each level. I'm a tinkerer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}